<title>USA: People's Choice TV Corp Q1 net loss.</title>
<headline>People's Choice TV Corp Q1 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>SHELTON, Conn. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	    1996</p>
<p> Revenues				  $8,544,000    $8,548,000</p>
<p> Net Loss				(16,519,000)  (17,281,000)</p>
<p> Net Loss Per Common Share (a)	   (1.38)	  (1.43)</p>
<p> Average Shrs outstanding	    13,151,000    13,069,000</p>
<p>(a) Reflects net loss adjusted by non-cash, pay-in-kind, preferred stock dividends in the amount of $1,588,000 in 1997 and $1,465,000 in 1996.</p>
<p>The company said its customer base declined 6 percent to 76,600 from 81,300 a year ago.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
